Oh, my gosh.</b></font>

3
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:10,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's one boy here
that I'm totally into!</b></font>

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:12,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Same here!
Do you mean the blonde guy?</b></font>

5
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:13,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, yeah!</b></font>

6
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:14,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's too beautiful to be real!</b></font>

7
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:16,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah? That guy?</b></font>

8
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both laughs]</b></font>

9
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:20,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 2B]
For real? Where?</b></font>

10
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:21,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What a cutie!</b></font>

11
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:24,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Takamine. Seto. Endou.</b></font>

12
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:25,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And Miura.</b></font>

13
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're all together.</b></font>

14
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:29,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's so crazy.</b></font>

15
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:32,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did all that stuff
really happen to me yesterday?</b></font>

16
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:34,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

17
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:35,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[metal creaking]</b></font>

18
00:00:35,370 --> 00:00:36,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm still doubting myself.</b></font>

19
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need to stop!</b></font>

20
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

21
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:41,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

22
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:42,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

23
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:45,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]
Morning.</b></font>

24
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:47,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So nice to see you again.</b></font>

25
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:48,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

26
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:50,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kai sighs]</b></font>

27
00:00:50,090 --> 00:00:51,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I don't know.</b></font>

28
00:00:51,390 --> 00:00:53,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe it really didn't happen.</b></font>

29
00:00:53,510 --> 00:00:55,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Speak up.</b></font>

30
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:56,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

31
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:00,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>C'mon, try again.</b></font>

32
00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:01,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

33
00:01:02,150 --> 00:01:03,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Morning!
-[all gasping]</b></font>

34
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:04,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

35
00:01:04,610 --> 00:01:05,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe scale it back?</b></font>

36
00:01:05,860 --> 00:01:07,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Morning, Ishimori!</b></font>

37
00:01:07,570 --> 00:01:09,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

38
00:01:09,150 --> 00:01:12,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Before, I started
my days with a prayer</b></font>

39
00:01:12,410 --> 00:01:14,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to keep my heart
out of harm's way.</b></font>

40
00:01:15,030 --> 00:01:16,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"Please let me
get through the day</b></font>

41
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:18,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as still as a stone."</b></font>

42
00:01:18,870 --> 00:01:21,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But starting today,
I won't ask for that.</b></font>

43
00:01:21,710 --> 00:01:22,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka whimpering]</b></font>

44
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Whoa, you good?</b></font>

45
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:25,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's kinda funny, huh?</b></font>

46
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:27,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

47
00:01:28,050 --> 00:01:29,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathing heavily]</b></font>

48
00:03:02,270 --> 00:03:03,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

49
00:03:04,230 --> 00:03:05,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>SPARKLE 2 TURNING
INTO A TREASURE</b></font>

50
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:07,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MARIN] Keep going!
Quick, take the shot!</b></font>

51
00:03:07,690 --> 00:03:08,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Uh-oh.</b></font>

52
00:03:09,020 --> 00:03:10,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's that stone face
we've heard about.</b></font>

53
00:03:11,020 --> 00:03:12,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, she's completely
frozen up.</b></font>

54
00:03:13,570 --> 00:03:16,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I can't move around
too much during gym class.</b></font>

55
00:03:16,450 --> 00:03:18,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You are always
getting in the way!</b></font>

56
00:03:18,450 --> 00:03:20,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stay back and don't move!</b></font>

57
00:03:20,410 --> 00:03:22,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Gotta make sure
I'm not in the way.</b></font>

58
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:25,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But still,
that does look like fun.</b></font>

59
00:03:25,910 --> 00:03:28,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh!
Now, she's pretending to play.</b></font>

60
00:03:28,330 --> 00:03:30,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Does she seem okay to you?</b></font>

61
00:03:30,340 --> 00:03:31,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What do you think?</b></font>

62
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:32,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Uh?
-Huh?</b></font>

63
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:35,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] Ayumi.
-Hm?</b></font>

64
00:03:35,090 --> 00:03:36,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
'Sup?</b></font>

65
00:03:36,970 --> 00:03:38,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whispering]</b></font>

66
00:03:38,390 --> 00:03:40,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm?
Uh, are you sure?</b></font>

67
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Just do it.</b></font>

68
00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:43,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[thumping]</b></font>

69
00:03:44,810 --> 00:03:46,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What was that?</b></font>

70
00:03:46,350 --> 00:03:47,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

71
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:49,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ASUMI]
Over here!</b></font>

72
00:03:49,230 --> 00:03:50,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MIKARIN] Pass the ball!
-[groaning]</b></font>

73
00:03:50,690 --> 00:03:51,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKINO]
Do something already!</b></font>

74
00:03:51,860 --> 00:03:52,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

75
00:03:52,940 --> 00:03:53,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Ishimori!</b></font>

76
00:03:54,030 --> 00:03:55,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

77
00:03:55,110 --> 00:03:57,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-But why her?
-Since when can she catch?</b></font>

78
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:59,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Endou actually
passed the ball to me.</b></font>

79
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:02,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Uka sighs]
-You got this! Go for it!</b></font>

80
00:04:02,530 --> 00:04:04,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Yeah, I have to try!</b></font>

81
00:04:04,330 --> 00:04:05,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gasps]
-Wait, what?</b></font>

82
00:04:05,910 --> 00:04:07,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I didn't realize
she could play basketball!</b></font>

83
00:04:07,750 --> 00:04:08,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

84
00:04:08,830 --> 00:04:09,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[metal creaking]</b></font>

85
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:11,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Oh!
-[gasping]</b></font>

86
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:13,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]
How's that?</b></font>

87
00:04:14,050 --> 00:04:15,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

88
00:04:17,050 --> 00:04:18,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

89
00:04:18,550 --> 00:04:20,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh...I'm sorry.</b></font>

90
00:04:20,970 --> 00:04:23,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all cheering]
[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

91
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ASUMI] You've got some
real moves, Ishimori!</b></font>

92
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU]
Yeah, nice shot!</b></font>

93
00:04:26,850 --> 00:04:28,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MARIN]
That was nothing but net!</b></font>

94
00:04:28,390 --> 00:04:30,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've imagined
doing that a lot before.</b></font>

95
00:04:30,690 --> 00:04:31,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

96
00:04:31,810 --> 00:04:33,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-How'd you know?
-Luck.</b></font>

97
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:35,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
No kidding?</b></font>

98
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, where are you going?</b></font>

99
00:04:36,820 --> 00:04:39,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kai told me to pass to you,
but I wasn't expecting that!</b></font>

100
00:04:40,030 --> 00:04:42,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Me too.
-I was nervous.</b></font>

101
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:44,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Really didn't wanna
put you on the spot.</b></font>

102
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
But, hey, I figured</b></font>

103
00:04:45,490 --> 00:04:47,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kai wouldn't say that
just to be mean.</b></font>

104
00:04:47,620 --> 00:04:48,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Yeah.</b></font>

105
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:50,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't think he would, either.</b></font>

106
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[clattering]</b></font>

107
00:04:52,750 --> 00:04:53,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S DAD]
I'm impressed.</b></font>

108
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It seems like your students
are actually taking</b></font>

109
00:04:56,050 --> 00:04:57,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>their studies seriously.</b></font>

110
00:04:57,710 --> 00:05:00,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I leave my daughter
in your capable hands.</b></font>

111
00:05:00,340 --> 00:05:02,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE] Very good.
There's nothing to worry about.</b></font>

112
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:04,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you, Mister Ishimori.</b></font>

113
00:05:04,220 --> 00:05:05,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good day, then.</b></font>

114
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:08,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

115
00:05:10,730 --> 00:05:11,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Yo, Ishimori.</b></font>

116
00:05:11,900 --> 00:05:13,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So...why'd you
pick this school?</b></font>

117
00:05:14,650 --> 00:05:16,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-[AYUMI] I wanna know, too!</b></font>

118
00:05:16,860 --> 00:05:18,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

119
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:19,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because it spoke to me.</b></font>

120
00:05:19,900 --> 00:05:22,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There are things here
I've only ever dreamed of.</b></font>

121
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:23,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Like what?</b></font>

122
00:05:23,780 --> 00:05:25,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The students here
are having fun.</b></font>

123
00:05:25,490 --> 00:05:26,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's a sense of freedom,</b></font>

124
00:05:26,990 --> 00:05:28,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like, in a good way.</b></font>

125
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can't argue there.</b></font>

126
00:05:30,370 --> 00:05:33,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hachimitsu's the perfect fit
if you wanna slack off a bit.</b></font>

127
00:05:33,250 --> 00:05:35,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We barely ever have
to study for tests,</b></font>

128
00:05:35,210 --> 00:05:37,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and our school events go
way harder than they need to!</b></font>

129
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:39,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Plus, the rules are lax.</b></font>

130
00:05:39,460 --> 00:05:40,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, how would you
wanna spend your time?</b></font>

131
00:05:40,970 --> 00:05:42,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

132
00:05:42,380 --> 00:05:44,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd like to hang out
with friends after school.</b></font>

133
00:05:44,930 --> 00:05:47,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe try staying out
past curfew for once.</b></font>

134
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:49,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] We could sneak
into the school after dark!</b></font>

135
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah!</b></font>

136
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:52,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I want to try it all!</b></font>

137
00:05:52,310 --> 00:05:53,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Anything I wouldn't do before!</b></font>

138
00:05:53,980 --> 00:05:55,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] Not happening.
-[gasps]</b></font>

139
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:56,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOGETHER]
Huh?</b></font>

140
00:05:56,610 --> 00:05:57,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Quit faking.</b></font>

141
00:05:57,770 --> 00:05:59,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you think you're like that?</b></font>

142
00:05:59,940 --> 00:06:01,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Cut the crap.</b></font>

143
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:03,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka gasps]</b></font>

144
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:04,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, c'mon, man.</b></font>

145
00:06:04,820 --> 00:06:06,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where's the attitude
coming from?</b></font>

146
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:07,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Lookie here!</b></font>

147
00:06:07,780 --> 00:06:09,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kai, wanna hang out?</b></font>

148
00:06:09,660 --> 00:06:10,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think I'll pass.</b></font>

149
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 2B]
Such a meanie!</b></font>

150
00:06:12,370 --> 00:06:13,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come chat with us, please!</b></font>

151
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:15,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 2A]
Your friends can come with,</b></font>

152
00:06:15,250 --> 00:06:16,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-if you want!
-Hey, are you okay?</b></font>

153
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, I'm all right.</b></font>

154
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:20,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Even if it's true,</b></font>

155
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:21,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't expect
to hear it from him.</b></font>

156
00:06:22,050 --> 00:06:23,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's go.</b></font>

157
00:06:23,220 --> 00:06:24,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

158
00:06:24,380 --> 00:06:26,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

159
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:28,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Hold up, Kai!</b></font>

160
00:06:29,060 --> 00:06:31,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't you think you were
kinda hard on her back there?</b></font>

161
00:06:31,430 --> 00:06:33,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Last I checked, you were
trying to help her, right?</b></font>

162
00:06:33,690 --> 00:06:35,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's a pain.</b></font>

163
00:06:35,150 --> 00:06:36,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Is that all you have to say?</b></font>

164
00:06:36,690 --> 00:06:38,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footfall]</b></font>

165
00:06:38,770 --> 00:06:40,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[machine whirring]</b></font>

166
00:06:41,070 --> 00:06:43,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

167
00:06:43,780 --> 00:06:46,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I can't deny
any of that, though.</b></font>

168
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:49,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not like my dreams
will really come true.</b></font>

169
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:51,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if things were
going well for a while.</b></font>

170
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:54,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've had a lot of dreams.</b></font>

171
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:56,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wonder...</b></font>

172
00:06:56,170 --> 00:06:58,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is everyone like this?</b></font>

173
00:06:58,540 --> 00:07:00,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[glass shattering]</b></font>

174
00:07:00,590 --> 00:07:01,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIZOGUCHI]
What are you doing?</b></font>

175
00:07:01,670 --> 00:07:02,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Masashi laughs]</b></font>

176
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:03,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASASHI]
Shut your trap!</b></font>

177
00:07:03,970 --> 00:07:04,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

178
00:07:05,050 --> 00:07:06,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 2F]
Someone call the cops!</b></font>

179
00:07:06,340 --> 00:07:07,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

180
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:09,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

181
00:07:10,180 --> 00:07:11,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
What's that?</b></font>

182
00:07:11,350 --> 00:07:12,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-This doesn't look good.
-Hm.</b></font>

183
00:07:12,930 --> 00:07:14,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

184
00:07:14,140 --> 00:07:15,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footfall]</b></font>

185
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:17,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI] That's right, Ishimori's
still in the classroom.</b></font>

186
00:07:18,810 --> 00:07:20,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'll find her in 1-B.</b></font>

187
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:21,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I never said
that I wanted you guys</b></font>

188
00:07:22,030 --> 00:07:23,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to show up here at our school!</b></font>

189
00:07:24,070 --> 00:07:25,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah? For my sake?</b></font>

190
00:07:25,740 --> 00:07:27,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, that's sweet and all.</b></font>

191
00:07:27,610 --> 00:07:29,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, right, and that
blonde jerk's name is Miura.</b></font>

192
00:07:30,700 --> 00:07:32,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, I don't know
where he's at...</b></font>

193
00:07:32,370 --> 00:07:33,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah?
[whimpering]</b></font>

194
00:07:34,710 --> 00:07:35,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI] [whimpering]
He's here!</b></font>

195
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I think he heard
everything I said!</b></font>

196
00:07:37,540 --> 00:07:39,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What are we supposed to do now?</b></font>

197
00:07:39,290 --> 00:07:40,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>See what I mean by a pain?</b></font>

198
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:42,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kai sighs]</b></font>

199
00:07:42,880 --> 00:07:43,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[running footsteps]</b></font>

200
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:45,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can say that...</b></font>

201
00:07:46,220 --> 00:07:48,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but off you go
sticking your nose in.</b></font>

202
00:07:48,180 --> 00:07:49,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

203
00:07:54,810 --> 00:07:56,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

204
00:07:56,190 --> 00:07:57,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What do I do?</b></font>

205
00:07:58,150 --> 00:07:59,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need to get
out of here, fast.</b></font>

206
00:08:00,020 --> 00:08:01,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh-huh!</b></font>

207
00:08:01,110 --> 00:08:03,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MASASHI] Hello!
-[gasps]</b></font>

208
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:05,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASASHI] We've got a special
delivery for someone!</b></font>

209
00:08:05,740 --> 00:08:08,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Oh, Ishimori!
-[gasps]</b></font>

210
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:11,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Class 1-B's very own Ishimori!</b></font>

211
00:08:11,620 --> 00:08:13,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Why are they looking for me?</b></font>

212
00:08:13,700 --> 00:08:16,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASASHI] Hey!
Get the hell out here, girly!</b></font>

213
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:17,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Masashi laughs]</b></font>

214
00:08:17,870 --> 00:08:19,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door slides open]</b></font>

215
00:08:19,580 --> 00:08:21,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where's Ishimori?</b></font>

216
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:23,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footfall]</b></font>

217
00:08:23,170 --> 00:08:24,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Bummer.</b></font>

218
00:08:24,340 --> 00:08:26,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't tell me you're not here?</b></font>

219
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:28,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASASHI'S MALE FRIEND 2A]
Nah, we're not gonna</b></font>

220
00:08:28,430 --> 00:08:30,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>fall for that so easily.</b></font>

221
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASASHI]
Just a matter of time.</b></font>

222
00:08:32,760 --> 00:08:34,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MASASHI] Come out, come out!
-[UKA] But why?</b></font>

223
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:36,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

224
00:08:36,890 --> 00:08:39,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] What did I do?
How did I make an enemy?</b></font>

225
00:08:39,810 --> 00:08:41,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

226
00:08:41,190 --> 00:08:42,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unless...</b></font>

227
00:08:42,940 --> 00:08:44,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, no.</b></font>

228
00:08:45,690 --> 00:08:46,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>See you.</b></font>

229
00:08:46,900 --> 00:08:47,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Masashi's male friend
2A scoffs]</b></font>

230
00:08:47,990 --> 00:08:49,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASASHI'S MALE FRIEND 2A] You
really suck at hide and seek.</b></font>

231
00:08:50,860 --> 00:08:52,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

232
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

233
00:08:53,410 --> 00:08:55,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come on,
don't play hard to get!</b></font>

234
00:08:55,490 --> 00:08:57,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka groaning]</b></font>

235
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:59,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There.
Sorry, baby.</b></font>

236
00:08:59,210 --> 00:09:00,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASASHI]
This is for my girlfriend.</b></font>

237
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, let's go.</b></font>

238
00:09:02,250 --> 00:09:03,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Why does it all
have to go bad now?</b></font>

239
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

240
00:09:05,300 --> 00:09:07,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My dreams were
starting to come true.</b></font>

241
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:09,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't let them end!</b></font>

242
00:09:09,170 --> 00:09:10,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] Ask someone for help.
-Hmph!</b></font>

243
00:09:11,010 --> 00:09:12,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah?</b></font>

244
00:09:12,140 --> 00:09:13,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
But who?</b></font>

245
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:15,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] Me.
-[UKA] Miura!</b></font>

246
00:09:16,010 --> 00:09:17,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

247
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah?</b></font>

248
00:09:18,930 --> 00:09:20,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

249
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:21,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

250
00:09:21,940 --> 00:09:23,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

251
00:09:25,860 --> 00:09:27,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stay back.</b></font>

252
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[rustling]</b></font>

253
00:09:31,780 --> 00:09:32,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both gasping]</b></font>

254
00:09:32,990 --> 00:09:34,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASASHI'S MALE FRIEND 2A]
Chill out.</b></font>

255
00:09:34,780 --> 00:09:36,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both screams]</b></font>

256
00:09:36,830 --> 00:09:38,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Weren't you looking for me?</b></font>

257
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:42,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Good news.
It's your lucky day.</b></font>

258
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You found me.</b></font>

259
00:09:45,290 --> 00:09:47,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't pull this bullshit again.
Yeah?</b></font>

260
00:09:47,710 --> 00:09:49,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]
Hey, Masashi!</b></font>

261
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:50,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI]
Miura's coming here...</b></font>

262
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Remi gasps]</b></font>

263
00:09:52,090 --> 00:09:54,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both whimpering]</b></font>

264
00:09:54,260 --> 00:09:55,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASASHI] You never said
he was the type</b></font>

265
00:09:55,180 --> 00:09:56,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to start throwing stuff!</b></font>

266
00:09:56,390 --> 00:09:58,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I never said you should
come here in the first place!</b></font>

267
00:09:58,560 --> 00:09:59,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASASHI]
No, I remember you told me--</b></font>

268
00:09:59,850 --> 00:10:00,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIZOGUCHI]
Hey!</b></font>

269
00:10:00,980 --> 00:10:02,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, we gotta run!</b></font>

270
00:10:02,140 --> 00:10:03,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIZOGUCHI]
Stop right there!</b></font>

271
00:10:03,230 --> 00:10:04,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll have you expelled!</b></font>

272
00:10:04,310 --> 00:10:05,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI]
No, please!</b></font>

273
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:07,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighing]</b></font>

274
00:10:08,690 --> 00:10:10,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah!
[sighing]</b></font>

275
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:12,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

276
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:16,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

277
00:10:19,870 --> 00:10:20,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Ah?</b></font>

278
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

279
00:10:23,580 --> 00:10:25,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] [chuckles]
Good timing.</b></font>

280
00:10:25,790 --> 00:10:28,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your dad would've fainted
if he had seen that.</b></font>

281
00:10:28,130 --> 00:10:29,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-But he took off.
-Huh?</b></font>

282
00:10:31,420 --> 00:10:33,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He was here? Why?</b></font>

283
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:35,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
He's worried about you.</b></font>

284
00:10:36,140 --> 00:10:37,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, go home.</b></font>

285
00:10:38,220 --> 00:10:40,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Was that why... Earlier...</b></font>

286
00:10:42,100 --> 00:10:44,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I put the thought in your head.</b></font>

287
00:10:44,190 --> 00:10:45,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll follow through.</b></font>

288
00:10:45,900 --> 00:10:48,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Do you realize
how silly your dreams are?</b></font>

289
00:10:48,270 --> 00:10:49,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're small.</b></font>

290
00:10:49,900 --> 00:10:51,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll make them all come true.</b></font>

291
00:10:51,990 --> 00:10:53,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

292
00:10:53,150 --> 00:10:54,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
So...</b></font>

293
00:10:54,700 --> 00:10:56,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>keep your ass out of trouble
for your dad's sake!</b></font>

294
00:10:56,990 --> 00:10:58,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

295
00:11:01,830 --> 00:11:03,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-And go home early from now on!
-Ah! Right!</b></font>

296
00:11:04,620 --> 00:11:06,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]
And such a pain.</b></font>

297
00:11:06,330 --> 00:11:07,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

298
00:11:07,790 --> 00:11:09,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

299
00:11:12,460 --> 00:11:14,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He protected me.</b></font>

300
00:11:14,170 --> 00:11:15,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And scolded me.</b></font>

301
00:11:15,510 --> 00:11:17,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hold on, this is too much!</b></font>

302
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:19,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need to process
everything that's happened.</b></font>

303
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:20,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need time!</b></font>

304
00:11:20,810 --> 00:11:22,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

305
00:11:23,270 --> 00:11:25,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Back then, I barely dreamt.</b></font>

306
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:28,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I couldn't chase them,
so why bother?</b></font>

307
00:11:29,060 --> 00:11:30,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

308
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:34,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But now, things are different.</b></font>

309
00:11:34,110 --> 00:11:36,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to make
my dreams reality.</b></font>

310
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:37,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[wind whooshing]</b></font>

311
00:11:38,950 --> 00:11:40,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can.</b></font>

312
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:42,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He makes it feel possible.</b></font>

313
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:43,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

314
00:11:43,700 --> 00:11:45,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Which can only mean one thing.</b></font>

315
00:11:46,750 --> 00:11:48,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even though
I've never experienced</b></font>

316
00:11:48,380 --> 00:11:49,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this feeling before?</b></font>

317
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:51,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

318
00:11:51,090 --> 00:11:52,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know...</b></font>

319
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:55,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when I look at Miura,
it's love.</b></font>

320
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:57,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

321
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:04,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footfall]</b></font>

322
00:12:06,140 --> 00:12:08,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't have social skills.</b></font>

323
00:12:08,270 --> 00:12:10,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't even have friends.</b></font>

324
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:12,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Romance is foreign to me.</b></font>

325
00:12:12,820 --> 00:12:14,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I had never
considered it before.</b></font>

326
00:12:14,230 --> 00:12:15,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exhales]</b></font>

327
00:12:15,650 --> 00:12:16,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

328
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:18,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

329
00:12:18,860 --> 00:12:20,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I can't deny it.</b></font>

330
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's someone I like, now.</b></font>

331
00:12:24,870 --> 00:12:26,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIZOGUCHI]
This'll be on the test,</b></font>

332
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so commit it to memory.</b></font>

333
00:12:27,620 --> 00:12:29,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you can't do that,
at least write it down.</b></font>

334
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And, Miura?
Wake up!</b></font>

335
00:12:31,750 --> 00:12:34,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Ah? Was I asleep?</b></font>

336
00:12:34,340 --> 00:12:35,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>More like "comatose."</b></font>

337
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:37,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIZOGUCHI] If only I could
be your age again.</b></font>

338
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:39,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You don't know
how good you have it.</b></font>

339
00:12:39,590 --> 00:12:40,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Living without a care
in your heart,</b></font>

340
00:12:40,970 --> 00:12:42,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or a thought in your head.</b></font>

341
00:12:42,100 --> 00:12:43,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
No, you're wrong.</b></font>

342
00:12:44,010 --> 00:12:46,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miura's the most thoughtful guy
I've ever met.</b></font>

343
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:48,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He pays attention
to the people around him,</b></font>

344
00:12:48,810 --> 00:12:50,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and he knows what they'll do.</b></font>

345
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:52,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Plus, he's always super honest
about what he thinks.</b></font>

346
00:12:53,770 --> 00:12:56,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Actually, if I'm being honest,</b></font>

347
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't even know him
well enough</b></font>

348
00:12:57,570 --> 00:12:58,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to talk about him like that.</b></font>

349
00:13:00,530 --> 00:13:02,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

350
00:13:03,830 --> 00:13:05,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wow, nice earrings!</b></font>

351
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:07,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

352
00:13:07,790 --> 00:13:08,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thanks, they're new!</b></font>

353
00:13:09,040 --> 00:13:10,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Oh, those are cute.</b></font>

354
00:13:10,750 --> 00:13:12,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They look great.
Seriously!</b></font>

355
00:13:12,670 --> 00:13:14,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

356
00:13:14,340 --> 00:13:15,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Where'd you get them?</b></font>

357
00:13:15,420 --> 00:13:18,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Hold on, she's blushing.</b></font>

358
00:13:18,130 --> 00:13:19,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Does she like him?
-Wanna go today? -Today?</b></font>

359
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:20,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] They could be dating,
for all I know.</b></font>

360
00:13:20,930 --> 00:13:21,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, sure.</b></font>

361
00:13:22,010 --> 00:13:24,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] But watching them,
even I can tell</b></font>

362
00:13:24,180 --> 00:13:25,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they have good chemistry.</b></font>

363
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:27,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wow.</b></font>

364
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:29,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

365
00:13:29,890 --> 00:13:31,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wonder how he really sees me.</b></font>

366
00:13:31,940 --> 00:13:33,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

367
00:13:33,980 --> 00:13:35,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>From that look?</b></font>

368
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:36,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A pain in the neck.</b></font>

369
00:13:36,860 --> 00:13:37,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Yo, Kai.</b></font>

370
00:13:37,940 --> 00:13:39,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Anyway...</b></font>

371
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need to focus on making sure</b></font>

372
00:13:40,740 --> 00:13:42,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't screw
things up for him.</b></font>

373
00:13:42,530 --> 00:13:44,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

374
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:46,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I'm just happy I get
to breathe the same air as him.</b></font>

375
00:13:47,700 --> 00:13:50,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-That's enough.
-So kinda like it, or whatever.</b></font>

376
00:13:50,460 --> 00:13:51,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] Huh?
-[AYUMI] Hm?</b></font>

377
00:13:51,580 --> 00:13:53,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where'd she go?</b></font>

378
00:13:53,250 --> 00:13:54,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Maybe she went home?</b></font>

379
00:13:54,790 --> 00:13:57,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

380
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:04,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footfall]</b></font>

381
00:14:07,010 --> 00:14:08,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh!</b></font>

382
00:14:09,770 --> 00:14:11,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have to wonder.</b></font>

383
00:14:11,350 --> 00:14:13,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do others see me
the same way I do?</b></font>

384
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:16,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is that Ishimori?</b></font>

385
00:14:16,270 --> 00:14:18,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, whoa.
Yep, that is her!</b></font>

386
00:14:18,230 --> 00:14:20,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Who is she?
-It's "Stony," the dweeb.</b></font>

387
00:14:20,860 --> 00:14:21,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 2H]
Oh, yeah!</b></font>

388
00:14:21,950 --> 00:14:22,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Woof, that uniform
does not look good.</b></font>

389
00:14:23,030 --> 00:14:24,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE COLLEGE STUDENT 2A]
Who's the nerdy chick?</b></font>

390
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:26,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-New friend of yours?
-Ew, seriously?</b></font>

391
00:14:26,700 --> 00:14:28,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just some girl that went
to junior high with us.</b></font>

392
00:14:28,950 --> 00:14:29,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh?</b></font>

393
00:14:30,040 --> 00:14:31,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, see ya later.</b></font>

394
00:14:31,500 --> 00:14:33,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all laugh]</b></font>

395
00:14:33,290 --> 00:14:36,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Miura said that stuff
back then for my protection.</b></font>

396
00:14:36,460 --> 00:14:39,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But still...even
if I know that,</b></font>

397
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:40,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it hurt.</b></font>

398
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:42,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
Sorry about that.</b></font>

399
00:14:42,420 --> 00:14:44,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It seems we got here
a little bit late.</b></font>

400
00:14:45,140 --> 00:14:46,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're too late for what?</b></font>

401
00:14:46,390 --> 00:14:47,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groaning]</b></font>

402
00:14:47,470 --> 00:14:48,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Uh-oh.</b></font>

403
00:14:48,810 --> 00:14:50,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is he mad at me
for some reason?</b></font>

404
00:14:50,930 --> 00:14:53,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now you go home earlier?
C'mon!</b></font>

405
00:14:54,060 --> 00:14:55,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You said...</b></font>

406
00:14:55,560 --> 00:14:56,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think Kai really wanted</b></font>

407
00:14:56,860 --> 00:14:58,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to hang out with you
after school.</b></font>

408
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:00,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-That right?
-Yeah?</b></font>

409
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:01,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Remember what I said.</b></font>

410
00:15:01,820 --> 00:15:03,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>About your dreams?</b></font>

411
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:04,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
You meant it?</b></font>

412
00:15:04,570 --> 00:15:06,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought you were joking!</b></font>

413
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:07,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like I'd joke about that!</b></font>

414
00:15:07,780 --> 00:15:09,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-You're such a pain.
-[gasps]</b></font>

415
00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:13,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Come on, let's get going.</b></font>

416
00:15:13,290 --> 00:15:14,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] [whimpering]
This is amazing.</b></font>

417
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:17,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't believe it.</b></font>

418
00:15:17,710 --> 00:15:19,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm so happy!</b></font>

419
00:15:19,090 --> 00:15:20,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

420
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:23,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But...I'm confused.</b></font>

421
00:15:24,340 --> 00:15:26,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Isn't he embarrassed to be
seen out in public with me?</b></font>

422
00:15:28,890 --> 00:15:31,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[sighs]
-[KAI] Yo, Stony.</b></font>

423
00:15:31,270 --> 00:15:32,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

424
00:15:32,980 --> 00:15:35,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Uh, that's not--
-Huh?</b></font>

425
00:15:35,310 --> 00:15:36,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Speak up!
-Oh.</b></font>

426
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:38,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I, just--
-I can't hear you!</b></font>

427
00:15:38,610 --> 00:15:39,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, now!</b></font>

428
00:15:40,020 --> 00:15:42,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>First things first.
What time is your curfew?</b></font>

429
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:43,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Oh, uh...</b></font>

430
00:15:43,820 --> 00:15:45,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's 5 o'clock.</b></font>

431
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:47,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Um?</b></font>

432
00:15:48,410 --> 00:15:50,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Forget it,
we'll do it some other time!</b></font>

433
00:15:50,950 --> 00:15:52,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Hey, I'm sorry, but--</b></font>

434
00:15:52,700 --> 00:15:54,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] I keep telling you
to stop apologizing!</b></font>

435
00:15:54,870 --> 00:15:56,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
It's just that I'm so sorr--</b></font>

436
00:15:56,160 --> 00:15:57,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-So what?
-Sorghum!</b></font>

437
00:16:00,380 --> 00:16:02,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-That supposed to be funny?
-[UKA] No, I--</b></font>

438
00:16:02,380 --> 00:16:03,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why in hell would you yell,
"Sorghum?"</b></font>

439
00:16:04,210 --> 00:16:05,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I wish I knew!</b></font>

440
00:16:05,090 --> 00:16:06,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
You're the one who said it!</b></font>

441
00:16:06,180 --> 00:16:07,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Tomoya groans]
-[UKA] I know.</b></font>

442
00:16:07,260 --> 00:16:08,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-So?
-[Tomoya chuckles]</b></font>

443
00:16:08,430 --> 00:16:10,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I swear!
-[Tomoya laughs]</b></font>

444
00:16:10,470 --> 00:16:11,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
Sorry.</b></font>

445
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:13,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right now,
it's just kinda hard to tell</b></font>

446
00:16:13,850 --> 00:16:15,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if you two get along at all.</b></font>

447
00:16:15,350 --> 00:16:17,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You really shouldn't be
worried about it, Ishimori.</b></font>

448
00:16:17,810 --> 00:16:19,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's the one who's being
awkward at the moment.</b></font>

449
00:16:19,810 --> 00:16:21,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He usually
doesn't talk to girls.</b></font>

450
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:22,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Huh?</b></font>

451
00:16:22,860 --> 00:16:24,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, and now you see why.</b></font>

452
00:16:24,740 --> 00:16:26,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

453
00:16:26,110 --> 00:16:28,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] You know, he said
something yesterday.</b></font>

454
00:16:30,030 --> 00:16:32,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He mentioned
following through with me.</b></font>

455
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:35,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I get all weird
and stony again,</b></font>

456
00:16:35,330 --> 00:16:37,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd be getting
in his way even more.</b></font>

457
00:16:37,660 --> 00:16:39,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Gotta pull myself together.</b></font>

458
00:16:39,250 --> 00:16:41,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA] What do you think?
Shall we walk you home?</b></font>

459
00:16:41,710 --> 00:16:44,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, I'll be all right.
Really!</b></font>

460
00:16:44,090 --> 00:16:45,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah, I mean,</b></font>

461
00:16:45,340 --> 00:16:46,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>aren't you on your
way somewhere?</b></font>

462
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:48,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're both off to karaoke.</b></font>

463
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:50,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Got a few folks waiting on us.</b></font>

464
00:16:50,340 --> 00:16:52,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Karaoke?</b></font>

465
00:16:52,350 --> 00:16:53,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Listen, would it be okay</b></font>

466
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:55,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if I walked with you,
just to the entrance?</b></font>

467
00:16:55,220 --> 00:16:57,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Dunno.
Where's your place?</b></font>

468
00:16:57,180 --> 00:16:58,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That way.</b></font>

469
00:16:58,270 --> 00:16:59,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just past
the pedestrian bridge.</b></font>

470
00:16:59,900 --> 00:17:01,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah?</b></font>

471
00:17:02,150 --> 00:17:04,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, I can walk you that far.</b></font>

472
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:05,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

473
00:17:05,650 --> 00:17:07,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

474
00:17:07,280 --> 00:17:08,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, go.</b></font>

475
00:17:08,780 --> 00:17:10,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll stay right here.</b></font>

476
00:17:11,070 --> 00:17:12,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footfall]</b></font>

477
00:17:14,330 --> 00:17:15,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[traffic humming]</b></font>

478
00:17:23,540 --> 00:17:25,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'm actually walking with him.</b></font>

479
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:27,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

480
00:17:31,130 --> 00:17:32,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you.</b></font>

481
00:17:33,890 --> 00:17:35,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I said, "Thank you, Kai!"</b></font>

482
00:17:36,010 --> 00:17:37,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I heard you the first time.</b></font>

483
00:17:37,770 --> 00:17:40,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just wanted you to know
that I really mean it.</b></font>

484
00:17:41,100 --> 00:17:43,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tell me, what do you really
think about yourself?</b></font>

485
00:17:43,730 --> 00:17:45,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

486
00:17:46,070 --> 00:17:48,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Me?
That I'm still like a stone.</b></font>

487
00:17:49,030 --> 00:17:51,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you ever gonna make up
your mind for good?</b></font>

488
00:17:51,530 --> 00:17:53,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Decide on being one way,
or the other?</b></font>

489
00:17:53,660 --> 00:17:55,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

490
00:17:55,870 --> 00:17:57,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Might as well just be a stone.</b></font>

491
00:17:57,370 --> 00:17:59,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

492
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:02,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, what else are you hiding?</b></font>

493
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:03,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"Hiding?"</b></font>

494
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:06,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Like how you're
not really bad at sports.</b></font>

495
00:18:06,250 --> 00:18:08,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, that just kinda happened.</b></font>

496
00:18:09,050 --> 00:18:10,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just think about it.</b></font>

497
00:18:10,170 --> 00:18:11,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How much you could do
if you tried.</b></font>

498
00:18:12,760 --> 00:18:14,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] There are
probably a lot of things.</b></font>

499
00:18:14,180 --> 00:18:15,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

500
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:17,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I mean, yeah,
I talked to you that night.</b></font>

501
00:18:19,390 --> 00:18:20,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was just the springboard.</b></font>

502
00:18:22,020 --> 00:18:23,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're the one
who took it from there</b></font>

503
00:18:23,440 --> 00:18:24,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and actually made the jump.</b></font>

504
00:18:25,770 --> 00:18:27,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't keep letting your
old self drag you down.</b></font>

505
00:18:27,820 --> 00:18:29,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

506
00:18:29,610 --> 00:18:31,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Be a stone.</b></font>

507
00:18:31,150 --> 00:18:32,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But be a gemstone.</b></font>

508
00:18:32,990 --> 00:18:34,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

509
00:18:34,700 --> 00:18:36,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

510
00:18:36,780 --> 00:18:38,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
You can want more.</b></font>

511
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:39,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Be a little greedy.</b></font>

512
00:18:41,080 --> 00:18:43,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And as for everybody
who gave you a hard time?</b></font>

513
00:18:43,210 --> 00:18:44,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Know that you're
better than them.</b></font>

514
00:18:45,790 --> 00:18:47,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now...</b></font>

515
00:18:47,590 --> 00:18:49,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you're taking your
first steps to happiness.</b></font>

516
00:18:49,670 --> 00:18:51,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

517
00:18:54,130 --> 00:18:56,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I always
hated that nickname.</b></font>

518
00:18:57,220 --> 00:19:00,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But he turned it into
something...precious.</b></font>

519
00:19:03,060 --> 00:19:05,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, now I have a new dream.</b></font>

520
00:19:06,100 --> 00:19:08,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] It may not
come true soon, but...</b></font>

521
00:19:10,230 --> 00:19:12,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You won't see me
as a pain ever again.</b></font>

522
00:19:12,820 --> 00:19:14,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh?</b></font>

523
00:19:14,110 --> 00:19:16,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

524
00:19:19,030 --> 00:19:20,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If someone was watching us now,</b></font>

525
00:19:20,870 --> 00:19:23,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they would think I was
just a bully making you cry.</b></font>

526
00:19:24,040 --> 00:19:25,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]
I'm--</b></font>

527
00:19:25,120 --> 00:19:26,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorghum?</b></font>

528
00:19:27,290 --> 00:19:29,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Ah!
-[laughs]</b></font>

529
00:19:29,500 --> 00:19:31,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't even know what that is.</b></font>

530
00:19:31,510 --> 00:19:33,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

531
00:19:34,260 --> 00:19:36,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

532
00:19:37,010 --> 00:19:38,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's okay.</b></font>

533
00:19:38,220 --> 00:19:39,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do whatever you want.</b></font>

534
00:19:40,970 --> 00:19:42,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] See you tomorrow.
-[KAI] Great.</b></font>

535
00:19:42,680 --> 00:19:44,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

536
00:19:46,100 --> 00:19:47,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

537
00:19:47,480 --> 00:19:48,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

538
00:19:57,820 --> 00:19:59,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

539
00:20:02,120 --> 00:20:03,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

540
00:20:03,330 --> 00:20:05,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I'm better than the
people who bullied me before.</b></font>

541
00:20:06,330 --> 00:20:07,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I deserve better!</b></font>

542
00:20:07,670 --> 00:20:09,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

543
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:11,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's already starting.</b></font>

544
00:20:11,590 --> 00:20:13,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm listening
to all the things he says</b></font>

545
00:20:13,340 --> 00:20:16,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and taking the first steps
to happiness.</b></font>

546
00:20:16,130 --> 00:20:18,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't think I'll ever meet
someone like him again.</b></font>

547
00:20:18,550 --> 00:20:20,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[crying]
Not for as long as I live.</b></font>

548
00:20:20,470 --> 00:20:21,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

549
00:20:21,970 --> 00:20:23,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not sure that
I'm even good enough</b></font>

550
00:20:23,470 --> 00:20:26,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to fall in love with him,
but oh, well!</b></font>

551
00:20:27,100 --> 00:20:29,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>'Cause there's
no turning back now!</b></font>

552
00:20:29,770 --> 00:20:31,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

553
00:22:04,990 --> 00:22:06,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

554
00:22:06,370 --> 00:22:07,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
Hm?</b></font>

555
00:22:07,740 --> 00:22:09,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seems like she'd do
whatever you asked her to.</b></font>

556
00:22:10,660 --> 00:22:12,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, she was lost before.</b></font>

557
00:22:12,290 --> 00:22:15,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once I set her straight,
she got weirdly attached to me.</b></font>

558
00:22:16,170 --> 00:22:17,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Tomoya chuckles]</b></font>

559
00:22:17,500 --> 00:22:19,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No one else even noticed
she existed.</b></font>

560
00:22:19,510 --> 00:22:20,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm?</b></font>

561
00:22:20,630 --> 00:22:22,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, it was easy
to rock her world.</b></font>

562
00:22:22,720 --> 00:22:24,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All it took was you
talking to her a bit.</b></font>

563
00:22:25,510 --> 00:22:26,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
There are worse things.</b></font>

564
00:22:27,720 --> 00:22:30,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And honestly?
I think she's pretty cute.</b></font>

565
00:22:30,520 --> 00:22:31,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

566
00:22:32,390 --> 00:22:34,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hah, of course,
I'm the kinda guy</b></font>

567
00:22:34,520 --> 00:22:35,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that thinks all girls are cute.</b></font>

568
00:22:36,060 --> 00:22:37,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

569
00:22:38,320 --> 00:22:40,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

570
00:22:40,110 --> 00:22:41,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I have a new dream.</b></font>

571
00:22:42,450 --> 00:22:44,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To get confident enough
in myself...</b></font>

572
00:22:45,030 --> 00:22:46,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so that I can tell Miura...</b></font>

573
00:22:47,740 --> 00:22:49,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm in love with him.</b></font>

574
00:22:50,250 --> 00:22:51,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's what I have to do.</b></font>

575
00:22:52,000 --> 00:22:53,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TO BE CONTINUED</b></font>

